hey all,


just writing because in order to setup my alsa card i had to do some
extra steps that might be documented better.

steps taken:
1) add to /etc/modules.d/alsa: options snd-hda-intel model=acer-aspire
(this is documented)
2) launch alsamixer, go to the capture screen, select the "capture" and
press spacebar + set to 75, d the same for "capture 1"

the capture simply didn't work otherwise.

kind regards,

